   "id": "hdr_sticky",
   "name": "HEADER",
   "parameters": {
    "content": "# NZAMY · AI Legal Tools (18 tools)\n\nAll 18 AI legal tools, one webhook per tool (matches `N8N_WEBHOOK_AI_*` registry).\n\n**Pattern per branch:** Webhook → Auth → Supabase profile+tier → credits check → Context → LLM (Arabic) → post-process → log `ai_usage_log` → deduct credit → **Respond to Webhook**.\n\n⚠️ Each branch needs a `Respond to Webhook` node (switch webhook responseMode to `responseNode` when building). **LLM key lives ONLY in n8n credentials.**\n\nCredits: draft=1, contracts=1, contract-review=1, direction-support=1, wargaming=2, analyze-strength=1, secretary=0, research=1, quick-answer=0(free), translate=1, case-brief=1, fee-calculator=0, letter=0, case-insight=0(cached), corp=1, gov=1, micro=0, ngo=0.",
